# physmem2 layout file: one line per chip position, "rank lane designator".
# Designators are illustrative -- take them from the module's own drawing.
# This sketch is a 2Rx8 non-ECC UDIMM: rank 0 on one side, rank 1 on the other.
# Which side is rank 0, and the lane-to-footprint order, are set by the layout.
0 0 U1
0 1 U2
0 2 U3
0 3 U4
0 4 U5
0 5 U6
0 6 U7
0 7 U8
1 0 U10
1 1 U11
1 2 U12
1 3 U13
1 4 U14
1 5 U15
1 6 U16
1 7 U17
